---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="RealReady Support"
  description="Get help with the RealReady real estate exam prep app: contact support, restore a purchase, manage study reminders, report a question, or delete your account."
>
  <article class="doc container">
    <header class="doc__header rise rise-1">
      <h1 class="doc__title">RealReady Support</h1>
      <p class="doc__meta">Help with the RealReady mobile app for iPhone, iPad, and Android</p>
    </header>

    <div class="doc__body rise rise-2">
      <p class="doc__intro">
        Stuck, spotted a wrong answer, or something isn&rsquo;t working? We read every message and reply personally.
      </p>

      <div class="callout">
        <p><strong>Email support</strong></p>
        <p><a href="mailto:support@nextchapterapps.com" class="email">support@nextchapterapps.com</a></p>
        <p>Include your device (for example iPhone 15 or Pixel 8), the state you&rsquo;re studying for, and what you expected to happen. Screenshots help.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Common questions</h2>
      <p>The <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a> covers pricing, which states are included, and how the free tier works. If your question isn&rsquo;t there, email us.</p>

      <h2>Restore a purchase</h2>
      <p>Premium is a one-time purchase tied to your Apple ID or Google account. On a new phone, or after reinstalling, sign in to your RealReady account and open <strong>Profile &rarr; Restore Purchases</strong>. If the store has nothing to restore, the app will say so; if a connection problem gets in the way, it will tell you that instead.</p>

      <h2>Report a question or explanation</h2>
      <p>Every question has thumbs up / thumbs down under its explanation. Tap thumbs down and tell us what&rsquo;s wrong &mdash; the report reaches us with the question attached. You can also use <strong>Profile &rarr; Send feedback</strong>.</p>

      <h2>Study reminders</h2>
      <p>If you stop studying, the app can send a few reminders over two weeks &mdash; never daily. Turn them on or off at <strong>Profile &rarr; Study reminders</strong>, or in your device&rsquo;s notification settings.</p>

      <h2>Delete your account</h2>
      <p>Go to <strong>Profile &rarr; Delete account</strong> and confirm. This removes your login, profile, quiz history, and feedback from our servers. If you can&rsquo;t get into the app, email <a href="mailto:support@nextchapterapps.com" class="email">support@nextchapterapps.com</a> from the address on the account and we&rsquo;ll delete it for you within 30&nbsp;days.</p>

      <h2>Legal</h2>
      <p><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="/terms/">Terms of Service</a></p>

      <p class="doc__meta">RealReady is made by Next Chapter Apps.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
